<p>Is mahe moharram me ajab hashr bapa hai</p>

<p>Ghar Ghar me mohibbo'n ke Hussaina ki sada hai<br />
is mahe moharram me ajab hashr bapa hai</p>

<p>Karbal me lahu pyase ka be jurm baha hai<br />
Is mahe moharram me ajab hashr bapa hai</p>

<p>1. Ghar Apna sajaakar ke mohib hote hain bechain<br />
romaal liye aati hain shahzadiye kounain<br />
Moula mera phir narga e aada me ghira hai</p>

<p>2. Chahmo me mere ashke aza bandh ke niyyat<br />
is saal bhi rehjaaye no koi inhe'n hasrat<br />
hijrat ke liye baandh ke samaane aza hai</p>

<p>3. Is maah me Shabbir(a.s) ne sar apna kataaya<br />
gurbat me musafir ne kafan bhi nahi paaya<br />
Jangal me chaman hazrate Zehra(s.a) ka luta hai</p>

<p>4. Jab chand moharram ka sare arsh hai aaya<br />
Dil thaam ke bimaar ne salma ko bulaaya<br />
Kehne lagi baba mera pabande buka hai</p>

<p>5. Cheh maah ki muddat hui ab tak nahi aaye<br />
us dasht me baba pa mere aanch na aaye<br />
tujhse mere malik meri bas ek dua hai</p>

<p>6. Paani ki talab aur bhi badh jaati thi usdam<br />
Sooraj ki tapish jismo'n ko julasti thi usdam<br />
Aise me Qayaamat hai ke baccho'n pa jafa hai</p>

<p>7. <b>Farmaan</b> lahad apni sitaro'n se sajaakar<br />
phir farse aza ashko'n ki chadar ko banaakar<br />
lo shaah e shahidaan pa rone ko chala hai</p>

<center><h4>Kalaam : Janaab Mohibbe Abid Abidi Sahab (Farmaan)</h4></center></p>
